* Antenna Array Section ngspice Netlist
* Based on structural.drawio Antenna Section
* Ant_A: Printed Dipole (0-900 MHz)
* Ant_B: Patch array 2x2 (1.2-3 GHz)
* Ant_C: Patch array 4x4 (4.0-7.0 GHz)
* PIN_Switches: range selection

VANT_A 1 0 AC 1
VANT_B 2 0 AC 1
VANT_C 3 0 AC 1
VPIN_SW 4 0 DC 0

* Dummy resistors for port definitions
RANT_A 1 0 50
RANT_B 2 0 50
RANT_C 3 0 50
RPIN_SW 4 0 50

* Frequency sweep notes:
* .AC DEC 10 100k 1GHz
* .PRINT AC V(1) V(2) V(3) V(4)

.END
